WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.999 line:0
Both players crack the same four-digit code,
no digit repeated. Fewest guesses wins.

00:00:06.999 --> 00:00:13.999 line:0
Tap the digits 1234, then Submit guess.

00:00:13.999 --> 00:00:16.999 line:0
The round resolves once both have guessed.

00:00:16.999 --> 00:00:25.999 line:0
1A2B: one digit is in the right place,
two more are right but in the wrong place.

00:00:25.999 --> 00:00:32.999 line:0
Guided by that, North tries 1452;
nobody sees another player’s guesses.

00:00:32.999 --> 00:00:35.998 line:0
1452 scores 2A1B.

00:00:35.998 --> 00:00:42.998 line:0
Fast-forward: the third guess, 0129, is 2A1B too.

00:00:42.998 --> 00:00:49.998 line:0
North’s fourth guess is 1429.

00:00:49.998 --> 00:00:52.998 line:0
4A: North cracks the code and stops guessing.

00:00:52.998 --> 00:00:59.997 line:0
Play goes on until everyone cracks it or uses ten;
East cracks it on the fifth guess.

00:00:59.997 --> 00:01:10.000 line:0
The code 1429 and every guess are revealed;
North used the fewest, four, and wins.
